      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1787982406093,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Optimisation Requirements\n1. Logistically opimise things to reduce travel costs\n2. sometimes 80% efficiency is ok - can be postponed\n3. Something that needs airtravel can also be achieved via road \nbut 80% more travel time but only 20% of the csto",
      "fontSize": 9.10969765936843,
      "fontFamily": 5,
