      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Optimisation Requirements\n1. Logistically opimise things to reduce travel costs\n2. sometimes 80% efficiency is ok - can be postponed\n3. Something that needs airtravel can also be achieved via road \nbut 80% more travel time but only 20% of the csto",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
